<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel gains on pulp price rise.</title>
<headline>Portucel gains on pulp price rise.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portucel - Empresa de Celulose e Papel de Portugal SA were rising on Monday after the company said it would be increasing pulp prices to 450 ecu per tonne from 400 ecus, effective May 1.</p>
<p>The stock was up 11 escudos at 1,126 escudos and traders said that it could try to test its 1997 high of 1,150 escudos. The share was slightly below an earlier high of 1,135 escudos.</p>
<p>&quot;A price rise is good news for Portucel,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>($1=172.77 escudos)</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau, 3511-3113125</p>
</text>
